IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa21-ch3-squeeze-out`

-- coa21-tests-ch3-squeeze-out.l4: tests for coa21-ch3-squeeze-out.l4 (Part 28, Chapter 3: ss 979 to 982).
-- Every expected value is written from the text of the section named beside it, before the run, and never copied from the code's output.

§ `Tests for Chapter 3, squeeze-out`

§§ `Fixtures: blocks of shares (class, value, votes, date allotted after the offer, status, whether subsection (10) applies)`

`s 979 test accepted 90` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 90, 90, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test accepted 89` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 89, 89, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test accepted 90 with 80 votes` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 90, 80, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test accepted 85` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 85, 85, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test not acquired 10` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test not acquired 11` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 11, 11, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test not acquired 10 with 20 votes` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 10, 20, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test not acquired 9` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 9, 9, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test not acquired 5` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 5, 5, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test allotted later 5 on 5 June 2027` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 5, 5, JUST (Date 5 6 2027), `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test other acquisition 5 within subsection (10)` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 5, 5, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by the offeror otherwise than by virtue of acceptances`, TRUE
`s 979 test other acquisition 5 outside subsection (10)` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 5, 5, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by the offeror otherwise than by virtue of acceptances`, FALSE
`s 979 test associate 10 within subsection (10)` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by an associate of the offeror`, TRUE
`s 979 test associate 10 outside subsection (10)` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by an associate of the offeror`, FALSE
`s 979 test conditional 10` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "ordinary", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 contracted to be acquired subject to conditions, not yet unconditional`, FALSE
`s 979 test class A accepted 90` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "A", 90, 90, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test class A not acquired 10` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "A", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE
`s 979 test class B accepted 10` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "B", 10, 10, NOTHING, `s 979 acquired or unconditionally contracted to be acquired by virtue of acceptances of the offer`, FALSE
`s 979 test class B not acquired 90` MEANS `s 979 block of shares` OF "B", 90, 90, NOTHING, `s 979 not acquired or contracted to be acquired`, FALSE

§§ `Assertions`

-- s 979(10): this subsection applies if the acquisition consideration does not exceed the offer's value, or the terms are revised so that it no longer does.
#ASSERT `s 979(10) this subsection applies` 100 100 FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(10) this subsection applies` 99 100 FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(10) this subsection applies` 101 100 FALSE 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(10) this subsection applies` 101 100 TRUE 101 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(10) this subsection applies` 101 100 TRUE 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 979(8) and (9).
#ASSERT `s 979(8) the shares are not excluded by section 977(1) and are treated as acquired by virtue of acceptances` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(8) the shares are not excluded by section 977(1) and are treated as acquired by virtue of acceptances` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(8) the shares are not excluded by section 977(1) and are treated as acquired by virtue of acceptances` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 979(9) the shares are not excluded by section 977(2)` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(9) the shares are not excluded by section 977(2)` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(9) the shares are not excluded by section 977(2)` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 979(5): a block allotted (or released from treasury) on or after the date of the entitlement is left out.
#ASSERT `s 979(5) the block is among the shares to which the offer relates on the date` `s 979 test accepted 90` (Date 5 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(5) the block is among the shares to which the offer relates on the date` `s 979 test allotted later 5 on 5 June 2027` (Date 4 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(5) the block is among the shares to which the offer relates on the date` `s 979 test allotted later 5 on 5 June 2027` (Date 5 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(5) the block is among the shares to which the offer relates on the date` `s 979 test allotted later 5 on 5 June 2027` (Date 6 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- how a block counts.
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test accepted 90` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 counts as shares to which the offer relates, acquired by virtue of acceptances`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test not acquired 10` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 counts as shares to which the offer relates only`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test other acquisition 5 within subsection (10)` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 counts as shares to which the offer relates, acquired by virtue of acceptances`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test other acquisition 5 outside subsection (10)` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 does not count as shares to which the offer relates`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test associate 10 within subsection (10)` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 counts as shares to which the offer relates only`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test associate 10 outside subsection (10)` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 does not count as shares to which the offer relates`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test conditional 10` (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 does not count as shares to which the offer relates`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test conditional 10` (Date 1 6 2027) TRUE EQUALS `s 979 counts as shares to which the offer relates only`
#ASSERT `s 979 how the block counts` `s 979 test allotted later 5 on 5 June 2027` (Date 5 6 2027) FALSE EQUALS `s 979 does not count as shares to which the offer relates`
-- s 979(1) and (3): which subsection applies.
#ASSERT `s 979(1) subsection (2) applies` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(1) subsection (2) applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(3) subsection (4) applies` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(3) subsection (4) applies` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 979(6): subsection (7) applies where the requirements are satisfied and shares are conditionally contracted.
#ASSERT `s 979(6) subsection (7) applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(6) subsection (7) applies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(6) subsection (7) applies` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 979(2)(a)-(b): the 90% requirements (boundary: exactly 90 of 100 in value and in votes).
#ASSERT `s 979(2)(a)-(b) the 90% requirements are met` (LIST `s 979 test accepted 90`, `s 979 test not acquired 10`) (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(2)(a)-(b) the 90% requirements are met` (LIST `s 979 test accepted 89`, `s 979 test not acquired 11`) (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(2)(a)-(b) the 90% requirements are met` (LIST `s 979 test accepted 90 with 80 votes`, `s 979 test not acquired 10 with 20 votes`) (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 979(2)(a)-(b) the 90% requirements are met` (LIST `s 979 test accepted 90 with 80 votes`, `s 979 test not acquired 10 with 20 votes`) (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 979(2)(a)-(b) the 90% requirements are met` EMPTY (Date 1 6 2027) FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- s 979(2): the offeror's right to give notice (one class).
#ASSERT `s 979(2) the offeror may give notice to the holder of the shares` (JUST TRUE) (LIST `s 979 test accepted 90`, `s 979 test not acquired 10`) (Date 1 6 2027) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
