-- s 980(8): the penalty (the daily default fine: one-fiftieth of the statutory maximum, or on the substituted words one-fiftieth of the greater of 5,000 pounds or level 4).
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on conviction on indictment` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 980(8) penalty` OF `on conviction on indictment`, JUST (Period OF 2, Years), JUST `a fine without a stated limit`, NOTHING, TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on summary conviction in England and Wales` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 980(8) penalty` OF `on summary conviction in England and Wales`, JUST (Period OF 12, Months), JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` 1), JUST (`s 980(8) a fraction of the statutory maximum` 0.02), TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on summary conviction in England and Wales` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 980(8) penalty` OF `on summary conviction in England and Wales`, JUST (Period OF 12, Months), JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` 1), JUST (`s 980(8) a fraction of the greater of an amount in pounds and a level on the standard scale for summary offences` 0.02 5000 4), TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on summary conviction in Scotland` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 980(8) penalty` OF `on summary conviction in Scotland`, JUST (Period OF 6, Months), JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` 1), JUST (`s 980(8) a fraction of the statutory maximum` 0.02), TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 980(8) penalty` OF `on summary conviction in Northern Ireland`, JUST (Period OF 6, Months), JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` 1), JUST (`s 980(8) a fraction of the statutory maximum` 0.02), TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 980(8) the penalty` `on summary conviction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

