#ASSERT `s 981(6) the offeror's duty has arisen` (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 12 4 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 981(6) the offeror's duty has arisen` (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 11 4 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 981(6) the offeror's duty has arisen` (Date 1 3 2027) (Date 13 4 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
